        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Qin Ding Ling tells Fang Zheng that the wine drinker Immortal Gu recipe is the symbol of human path prosperity and the path Heavenly Court will focus on in the future, while even a successful golden bottle drunken wine strike on Wu Shuai would only hit a clone.",
